        feedback: "Followed the flange-up rule and used 1-1/4\" screws on RC-Deluxe channels. Before this remodel, we could hear our neighbor's conversation word-for-word. Now with mineral wool and dual 5/8\" drywall, their loud subwoofer sounds like a faint distant hum.",
        keyTakeaway: "Mark your stud locations with chalk on the ceiling before hanging drywall so you know where NOT to drive field screws."
      },
